; KinectNavigatorV2 -- Kinect20.dll proxy exports.
;
; Legacy.exe imports this one function BY NAME from Kinect20.dll (confirmed
; via dumpbin /exports on the genuine DLL -- it publishes GetDefaultKinectSensor
; undecorated). Our extern "C" __stdcall definition decorates to the x86
; stdcall symbol on the right; this maps the published name back to it, same
; pattern as src/KinectNavigator/exports.def.

EXPORTS
    GetDefaultKinectSensor=_GetDefaultKinectSensor@4
